        "title": "BrowserOS MCP Server",
        "version": "1.1.0"
      },
      "instructions": "You are driving the BrowserOS webview via MCP tools.\n- Prefer finishing in the current page: navigate, click, type, scroll, read text, take snapshots.\n- Give each step a concrete check: snapshot or getText to verify the effect before moving on.\n- Tidy up when a task finishes: close tabs you opened for this task unless the user\n  asked to keep them or a page is still useful for inspection.\n- The back/forward tools share the page history; use them instead of re-navigating when possible."
    }
